# Full default severity (style included). Fix findings by restructuring the
# code; an inline disable needs a genuinely unfixable false positive and a
# justification, and none exist today. No global suppressions here.
# Follow sourced files so shared helpers are checked in their callers'
# context; `# shellcheck source=` directives resolve against these paths.
external-sources=true
source-path=SCRIPTDIR
source-path=.
